message: "If you use this research repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Evgeny's Theory of Everything"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "RFT-SIRM"
date-released: 2026-10-15
url: "https://github.com/RFT-SIRM/Evgeny-s-Theory-of-Everything"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A mathematical research repository collecting formalization and computational
  evidence concerning recursive graph operators, spectral invariants, trace
  moments, and higher-moment recurrence conjectures. The universal higher-moment
  recurrence remains open; finite-level coefficient certificates and numerical
  holdouts must not be cited as an all-level proof.
